    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kitty Collapse \u2013 Blow it all down!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kitty Collapse</i> is a first-person physics destruction game where your goal is simple: <strong>collapse the buildings and clear out the cats</strong>. Use a growing arsenal of weapons to blast through structures packed with mischievous felines. Each level challenges your aim, timing, and sense of strategy\u2014<strong>the fewer shots you use, the higher your score</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde8 How it works:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based destruction</strong> \u2013 Every building reacts to your attacks in real time. Aim smart, collapse structures, and watch the chaos unfold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cat-filled levels</strong> \u2013 Each structure is a puzzle of support beams, explosives, and hiding cats. Knock them all out to win.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One goal</strong> \u2013 Cause as much destruction as possible with precision and efficiency.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962330/extras/fbe94ac03bb39c3f101176571c793137.poster.avif?t=1755367102\" width=606 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962330/extras/fbe94ac03bb39c3f101176571c793137.webm?t=1755367102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962330/extras/fbe94ac03bb39c3f101176571c793137.mp4?t=1755367102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive Arsenal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a diverse collection of  extraordinary weapons, each uniquely engineered to wreak havoc on structures and outwit cat adversaries. From triggering explosive chain reactions to deploying inventive gadgets like expanding cubes and lava tornadoes, every weapon offers a new way to approach your tactical battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962330/extras/ed27c02a91b5e333df8b4eaac429e0e8.poster.avif?t=1755367102\" width=606 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962330/extras/ed27c02a91b5e333df8b4eaac429e0e8.webm?t=1755367102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962330/extras/ed27c02a91b5e333df8b4eaac429e0e8.mp4?t=1755367102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructive Gameplay: Inspired by the mechanics of games like Angry Birds and Teardown, use precision and strategy to topple buildings and overcome obstacles in your path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962330/extras/9efc2e53b7bbc564afa8e31a6b4500e5.poster.avif?t=1755367102\" width=606 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962330/extras/9efc2e53b7bbc564afa8e31a6b4500e5.webm?t=1755367102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962330/extras/9efc2e53b7bbc564afa8e31a6b4500e5.mp4?t=1755367102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant Environments: Each map offers a new visual theme and architectural style, requiring you to adapt your strategy and weapon choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Levels and Challenges: Navigate through a series of diverse environments, each presenting unique challenges that will test your tactical skills and creativity. Explore and liberate varied landscapes, adapting your strategy with every new scene to effectively use your arsenal and outmaneuver the cat empire.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kitty Collapse \u2013 Blow it all down!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kitty Collapse</i> is a first-person physics destruction game where your goal is simple: <strong>collapse the buildings and clear out the cats</strong>. Use a growing arsenal of weapons to blast through structures packed with mischievous felines. Each level challenges your aim, timing, and sense of strategy\u2014<strong>the fewer shots you use, the higher your score</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde8 How it works:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based destruction</strong> \u2013 Every building reacts to your attacks in real time. Aim smart, collapse structures, and watch the chaos unfold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cat-filled levels</strong> \u2013 Each structure is a puzzle of support beams, explosives, and hiding cats. Knock them all out to win.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One goal</strong> \u2013 Cause as much destruction as possible with precision and efficiency.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962330/extras/fbe94ac03bb39c3f101176571c793137.poster.avif?t=1755367102\" width=606 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962330/extras/fbe94ac03bb39c3f101176571c793137.webm?t=1755367102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962330/extras/fbe94ac03bb39c3f101176571c793137.mp4?t=1755367102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive Arsenal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a diverse collection of  extraordinary weapons, each uniquely engineered to wreak havoc on structures and outwit cat a